+import QIKVRTFormalization.TEMDD.Correctness
+
+/-!
+# TEMDD correctness entry point
+
+This repository-root file is the requested direct entry point for
+Tested Event Model Driven Development (TEMDD) completion correctness.
+
+The checked implementation lives in the existing Std-only formalization
+library at:
+
+`formalization/QIKVRT_Formalization_v2.0/QIKVRTFormalization/TEMDD/Correctness.lean`
+
+Run it through the pinned Formalization-v2 Lake environment so that the
+`QIKVRTFormalization` import path is available.
+-/
